{"4552160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Help Me Get Up", "steam_appid": 4552160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Sky is Your Only Escape. Death is Your Only Shortcut.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world reclaimed by the undead and ruled by desperate scavengers, the ground is a death sentence. Your only hope? <strong>Up.</strong> <strong>[HELP ME GET UP]</strong> is a punishing top-down survival platformer where every step forward is a gamble, and every fall could be your last. Scavenge, fight, and climb through a vertical wasteland of precarious scaffolding, ruined skyscrapers, and makeshift bridges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/38d30248ccdf46f8cac76a7f4b3b5c3c.poster.avif?t=1775147253\" width=668 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/38d30248ccdf46f8cac76a7f4b3b5c3c.webm?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/38d30248ccdf46f8cac76a7f4b3b5c3c.mp4?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Higher You Get, The Harder They Hit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The air gets thinner, the platforms get narrower, and the enemies get smarter. You aren't just fighting gravity—you’re fighting for your next meal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Survival:</strong> This isn't just a climb; it's a race against depletion. Manage your <strong>hunger and thirst</strong> while navigating complex aerial puzzles. If you don’t find food in the ruins of an old apartment hanging 500 feet in the air, you won’t make it to the next floor.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/013e4d1826a749b7f5f7d2a98f91650b.poster.avif?t=1775147253\" width=644 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/013e4d1826a749b7f5f7d2a98f91650b.webm?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/013e4d1826a749b7f5f7d2a98f91650b.mp4?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge or Starve:</strong> Explore off-path ledges and dangerous rooms to find weapons, medical supplies, and canned goods. Will you risk a 3-story drop for a shotgun, or play it safe with a lead pipe?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/b36602e231ae00655058ed4500982265.poster.avif?t=1775147253\" width=800 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/b36602e231ae00655058ed4500982265.webm?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/b36602e231ae00655058ed4500982265.mp4?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Top-Down Combat:</strong> Fight off relentless <strong>Zombies</strong> that will lung at you and <strong>Bandits</strong> who want your loot. Use the environment to your advantage—sometimes the best way to deal with a bandit is to knock them off the ledge.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/f1b3c199c44348c1203c73dc1b6197bf.poster.avif?t=1775147253\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/f1b3c199c44348c1203c73dc1b6197bf.webm?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/f1b3c199c44348c1203c73dc1b6197bf.mp4?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Checkpoints, No Mercy:</strong> Much like the legendary climbing games of old, there are no save points here. If you slip, you fall. How far you fall depends on your luck and your reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Exploration:</strong> Use the top-down perspective to scout the path ahead. Look for structural weaknesses, hidden loot crates, and enemy patrols before making your move.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Sky is Your Only Escape. Death is Your Only Shortcut.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world reclaimed by the undead and ruled by desperate scavengers, the ground is a death sentence. Your only hope? <strong>Up.</strong> <strong>[HELP ME GET UP]</strong> is a punishing top-down survival platformer where every step forward is a gamble, and every fall could be your last. Scavenge, fight, and climb through a vertical wasteland of precarious scaffolding, ruined skyscrapers, and makeshift bridges.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/38d30248ccdf46f8cac76a7f4b3b5c3c.poster.avif?t=1775147253\" width=668 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/38d30248ccdf46f8cac76a7f4b3b5c3c.webm?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/38d30248ccdf46f8cac76a7f4b3b5c3c.mp4?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Higher You Get, The Harder They Hit</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The air gets thinner, the platforms get narrower, and the enemies get smarter. You aren't just fighting gravity—you’re fighting for your next meal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Survival:</strong> This isn't just a climb; it's a race against depletion. Manage your <strong>hunger and thirst</strong> while navigating complex aerial puzzles. If you don’t find food in the ruins of an old apartment hanging 500 feet in the air, you won’t make it to the next floor.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/013e4d1826a749b7f5f7d2a98f91650b.poster.avif?t=1775147253\" width=644 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/013e4d1826a749b7f5f7d2a98f91650b.webm?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/013e4d1826a749b7f5f7d2a98f91650b.mp4?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge or Starve:</strong> Explore off-path ledges and dangerous rooms to find weapons, medical supplies, and canned goods. Will you risk a 3-story drop for a shotgun, or play it safe with a lead pipe?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/b36602e231ae00655058ed4500982265.poster.avif?t=1775147253\" width=800 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/b36602e231ae00655058ed4500982265.webm?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/b36602e231ae00655058ed4500982265.mp4?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Top-Down Combat:</strong> Fight off relentless <strong>Zombies</strong> that will lung at you and <strong>Bandits</strong> who want your loot. Use the environment to your advantage—sometimes the best way to deal with a bandit is to knock them off the ledge.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/f1b3c199c44348c1203c73dc1b6197bf.poster.avif?t=1775147253\" width=800 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/f1b3c199c44348c1203c73dc1b6197bf.webm?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4552160/extras/f1b3c199c44348c1203c73dc1b6197bf.mp4?t=1775147253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Checkpoints, No Mercy:</strong> Much like the legendary climbing games of old, there are no save points here. If you slip, you fall. How far you fall depends on your luck and your reflexes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Exploration:</strong> Use the top-down perspective to scout the path ahead. Look for structural weaknesses, hidden loot crates, and enemy patrols before making your move.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The ground belongs to the undead—your only escape is up. Scavenge ruined skyscrapers for supplies, fight off desperate survivors, and manage your hunger in a high-stakes vertical wasteland. Every step is a gamble; every fall is a tragedy. Stay alive. Stay climbing.", "sup